      "statement": "Kyverno 1.13.0 adds an optional apiCall.default field to API call context entries (spec.rules[].context[].apiCall.default on ClusterPolicy and Policy, mirrored under the same path in v2beta1 and under spec.context[].apiCall.default on CleanupPolicy and ClusterCleanupPolicy) that provides a fallback value for the context entry when the API server returns an error."
